mutation ignore a closed revision and replay a cancelled creation with expected null
detects NoNullReplayAfterClose
-            knownRevision == db.rev
+            knownRevision == IF db.shape = 0 THEN 0 ELSE db.rev

mutation permit a stale writer to replace or cancel a newer active plan
detects RevisionGuards
-            status == IF ~valid THEN 422 ELSE IF same THEN 200 ELSE IF expected # knownRevision THEN 409 ELSE 200
+            status == IF ~valid THEN 422 ELSE 200

mutation recreate the same schedule and its consumed ready event on retry
detects ExactRetryUnchanged
-            replace == status = 200 /\ ~same /\ (s # 0 \/ db.shape # 0)
+            replace == status = 200 /\ (s # 0 \/ db.shape # 0)

mutation acknowledge a changed plan before storing it
detects AckAfterCommit
-     /\ pc = "committed" /\ pc' = "idle"
+     /\ pc \in {"update","committed"} /\ pc' = "idle"

mutation admit updates while the alarm handler owns the device
detects ExclusiveOperations
- Begin(s,expected) ==
-     /\ pc = "idle"
+ Begin(s,expected) ==
+     /\ pc \in {"idle","alarm"}

mutation expire closed state immediately and reopen the null revision
detects TombstoneLifetime
- Closed(nonce) == [shape |-> 0, rev |-> nonce, done |-> FALSE, oldShape |-> db.shape, closedAt |-> now, until |-> now+Horizon]
+ Closed(nonce) == [shape |-> 0, rev |-> nonce, done |-> FALSE, oldShape |-> db.shape, closedAt |-> now, until |-> now]
